          </child>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-2eff183562c54648b084af8b708d07e7" fillColor="#9FC5E8" archimateElement="id-9f8bd1cbc38f42f5bca1951582b981e2">
            <bounds x="265" y="235" width="225" height="48"/>
          </child>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-0688261c8ae54efc9d3bcb73a9beef7c" textAlignment="0" fillColor="#F3F8FC">
            <bounds x="20" y="300" width="470" height="108"/>
            <content>EVENTOS PRINCIPALES (no exhaustivos)
Origen/patrón completo: Tarifación—Customer/Supplier · Propietarios/Yates—Customer/Supplier + PL · Riesgo—Customer/Supplier + PL · Cumplimiento—Customer/Supplier + PL · Pagos—ACL + PL · Marinas—Alianza · Liquidación—Customer/Supplier.</content>
          </child>
        </child>
